  "description": "The traditional fairy tale we all know is actually a crime drama about the shapeshifters who fled from the sky! \n\nThis story is about a fox sent down from the sky and Joseon’s greatest gisaeng swindler, Cho-Ran. Many skillful storytellers turn the gears of fairy tales around to talk about the evil gods and goblins who torment humankind, but let us now start a true story of love that will make even the sky tear. \n\n(Source: Naver)",
